      "translation": "你为什么要追随修恩扎伊特？<br>那家伙只把我们当成工具。"
    },
    {
      "start": 8493,
      "end": 13036,
      "source_sha256": "42224cfadd5dca58ccf455b2cf014545f4245b2683d201d161b94ea5c5c42d8f",
      "translation": "对我而言……他就像父亲一样。"
    },
    {
      "start": 13442,
      "end": 17133,
      "source_sha256": "07170ce2ed4431e4259c21a299ab251f1ce50cf360f2f198d6452908b8682390",
      "translation": "要是没有你……我就是一号了……"
    },
    {
      "start": 17186,
      "end": 18913,
      "source_sha256": "1dfa9cd3e10c41e1a010be2a11f60af60a65cbbb9265c147ec166e6362ead895",
