    },
    {
      "start": 19133,
      "end": 27756,
      "source_sha256": "6ead30ae27d10245f091e22c459d5fa30303c1c9acccc89fbc922388a69940db",
      "translation": "呵……反正，你也<br>救不了那个女人。"
    },
    {
      "start": 28033,
      "end": 31194,
      "source_sha256": "7a97c4dbe3b12fcecf04423377861a16d0b8f8b3222e46e5543885777ef9076f",
      "translation": "不，我一定会救出洁菲！"
    },
    {
